Doumoh
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
NAEGI 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
NAEGI 8 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE NAEGI NAEGI
AND
    OR
        DEST Size < 10
        DESTSRC Rank equal
    DESTSRC Suit match
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL NAEGI Empty
        PILE ALL NAEGI Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL NAEGI Empty
        PILE ALL NAEGI Empty
